97
00:07:44,595 --> 00:07:47,857
[SPEAKER_01]: On one occasion, the Blessed One was dwelling in Savatthi, in Jesus' grove.

98
00:07:49,018 --> 00:07:56,042
[SPEAKER_01]: Now, on that occasion, a mother and son, being respectively a bhikkhuni and a bhikkhu, had entered the rains residence at Savatthi.

99
00:07:57,023 --> 00:07:59,224
[SPEAKER_01]: They often wanted to see one another.

100
00:07:59,645 --> 00:08:02,807
[SPEAKER_01]: The mother often wanted to see her son, and the son his mother.

101
00:08:03,647 --> 00:08:07,671
[SPEAKER_01]: Because they often saw one another, a bond was formed.

102
00:08:07,691 --> 00:08:11,094
[SPEAKER_01]: Because a bond formed, intimacy arose.

103
00:08:11,794 --> 00:08:17,459
[SPEAKER_01]: Because there was intimacy, lust found an open.

104
00:08:18,420 --> 00:08:25,847
[SPEAKER_01]: With their minds in the grip of lust, without having given up the training and declared their weakness, they engaged in sexual intercourse.

105
00:08:27,786 --> 00:08:33,269
