106
00:08:34,430 --> 00:08:35,350
[SPEAKER_01]: The Blessed One said,

107
00:08:43,902 --> 00:08:58,133
[SPEAKER_01]: Because I do not see even one other form that is as tantalizing, sensuous, intoxicating, captivating, infatuating, and as much of an obstacle to achieving the unsurpassed security from bondage as the form of a woman.

108
00:08:59,574 --> 00:09:12,364
