[SPEAKER_01]: But with a woman, one-to-one, one should never talk.

119
00:10:08,131 --> 00:10:16,600
[SPEAKER_01]: They bind one whose mind is muddled with a glance and a smile, with their dress in disarray, and with their gentle speech.

120
00:10:17,580 --> 00:10:21,424
[SPEAKER_01]: It is not safe to approach such a person, though she is swollen and dead.

121
